      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 is an example of an HEA coating deposited on a transition-metal matrix.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The representative HEA material has a BCC solid-solution structure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1",
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The CuMoTaWV coating has an average grain size of approximately 18 nm.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The CuMoTaWV coating has a hardness of approximately 19 GPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sliding tests use a steel counterface and a constant normal load of 1 N at temperatures from room temperature to 300 degrees C.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1",
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::fbf664005e234ec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tribological tests are conducted in air against an alloy-steel counterball.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::fbf664005e234ec9",
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxides, including CuO or other mixed oxides, form on the wear track or counterface during elevated-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::fbf664005e234ec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "At moderate temperature, the tribo-oxide layer acts as a solid lubricant.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At high temperature, the oxide layer becomes thick and unstable.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "From room temperature to approximately 200 degrees C, the coating maintains high hardness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A protective oxide layer reduces friction and wear at moderate elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 300 degrees C, tribochemical reactions increase the coefficient of friction of CuMoTaWV from about 0.25 to above 1.0.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::fbf664005e234ec9",
        "PMC7304825::hypothesis_evidence_v2::ea3e639539e10bc1"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear resistance improves slightly between room temperature and approximately 200 degrees C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
